			<tr>
				<td class="rightheader">Description:</td>
				<td class="body">Ok this is hopefully going to be a fun raid of inside the Sarnak Fortress in LOIO. <br />
<br />
There are a few decent items we could get along the way and I would like to keep them and hand out items at the end to whoever they suit the best (Sarnak Earring of Station goes to me..LOL).<br />
<br />
The main MOB is level 40 and drops the Shaman spear called jade Chodokai Prod.  He also has a Lvl 26 pet with him.  He is a Shaman so will have a lot of debuffs and DOT's to throw at us. <br />
<br />
Kodomo wil lbe leading and we can hopefully get a several of the others involved.  Would like Aorin and Donya to both attend and as many people as we can.  <br />
<br />
Some of the MOB's further in are difficult and the only time I have been deep a low a level 30 group which resulted in a CR.  Would also be helpful if you can get a map of the fortress (EQ Atlas has 1) and can get to Kunark in time for raid to start. <br />
<br />
I will hopefully give more info closer to time.  Please post in the thread I have posted on our guild board if you are interested in attending.</td>
